  "description": "Quack! is a fast, lightweight and user-friendly game engine built on SDL and its extensions (SDL_image, SDL_mixer, SDL_ttf). Designed for modern .NET 9+ applications, it provides a clean, flexible and intuitive API that simplifies game development by hiding low-level complexities. It uses SDL for 2D (Renderer) and 3D (GPU) rendering, window management, input handling and audio.",
